{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2023-06-08 09:00:00', 'title': 'DUPONT PERFORMANCE BUILDING SOLUTIONS RECEIVES 2023 AMERICAN CHEMISTRY COUNCIL (ACC) SUSTAINABILITY LEADERSHIP AWARD', 'text': 'STYROFOAM™ BRAND ST-100 EXTRUDED POLYSTYRENE FOAM (XPS) RECOGNIZED IN ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION CATEGORY WILMINGTON, DEL. , JUNE 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUPONT™ STYROFOAM™ BRAND ST-100 EXTRUDED POLYSTYRENE FOAM (XPS) HAS RECEIVED THE 2023 ACC SUSTAINABILITY LEADERSHIP AWARD IN THE ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION CATEGORY.'}